# This project's correctness depends on exact line endings, so pin them rather
# than leaving it to the ambient core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# Test fixtures are exempt. Their line endings are the thing under test — a CRLF
# fixture normalized to LF on commit would silently stop testing CRLF handling,
# and would come back as LF in a fresh clone. `-text` disables all conversion, so
# these files round-trip byte for byte.
test/cases/** -text
